{
    "background_story": "Ivory was a majestic swan who lived in a serene lake surrounded by lush greenery. She was known for her striking white feathers and graceful movements. Ivory was a devoted partner, forming a lifelong bond with her mate, Orion. Together, they built a cozy nest and raised their cygnets with love and care. As a monogamous species, swans are renowned for their fidelity, and Ivory was no exception. She and Orion remained inseparable, sharing tender moments and exploring the lake's depths side by side. Even when Orion fell ill, Ivory nursed him back to health, never leaving his side. Their love story became a legend among the lake's inhabitants, a testament to the power of loyalty and commitment in the natural world.",
